Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: compulab: disable the unwired Bluetooth SCO card

Keep the SCO sound card disabled while its SAI1 CPU DAI is disabled.
Boards wiring SAI1 PCM must enable the interface and card together.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/ucm-imx95-som.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/ucm-imx95-som.dts
@@ -264,6 +264,8 @@
 
 	sound-bt-sco {
 		compatible = "simple-audio-card";
+		/* Enable this card together with its SAI1 PCM interface. */
+		status = "disabled";
 		simple-audio-card,name = "bt-sco-audio";
 		simple-audio-card,format = "dsp_a";
 		simple-audio-card,bitclock-inversion;
